From: A6L port maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] android: match camera metadata tags to Android17 platform

Capture requests from the current Android framework include standard tags
missing from the bundled metadata schema. The clone path asserts when its
strict validator sees an unknown standard tag. Update generated tag enum/type
tables together from the same platform revision; keep structural/type checks.

